2. Difference between while, do-while, and for loops

Loop	Syntax	Condition Check	Use Case

while	while(condition){...}	Before loop starts	When number of iterations unknown
do-while	do{...}while(condition);	After first iteration	To ensure loop runs at least once
for	for(init; condition; update){...}	Before each iteration	When number of iterations known



